      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST LIKE NUGGET (3) made it two wins and a minor placing from his last three starts when he scored by 1.5 metres on September 2 over 2200m at Ballarat when sent out as the $3.20 favourite. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Must raise the bar but he has the ability to test this field. PRESIDENTIALCHANGE (1) veteran who drew a wide gate last start and was never a genuine threat, beaten 10 metres into sixth at Terang over 2180m. Likely to get all the favours from this better draw. Taking on a better field but he is capable of running a much better race. FARROH JOE (2) is better than his last-start seventh over 2240m at Melton would suggest. Meets an easier line-up here and can atone. THE BLAZINBOOTS (5) showed pleasing improvement last time out when runner-up over 2180m at Terang. Having his first start at this track and has each-way claims.",
